# Backend (Spring Boot 3 / Java 21)

Single Maven module at `backend/`. Run: `cd backend && mvn test` | `mvn spring-boot:run`.

## Packages

`com.ngs.analytics.{auth,projects,upload,analytics,fastq,vcf,reports,domain,common}`

Business logic: `fastq/FastqParser.java`, `vcf/VcfParser.java`, `analytics/AnalysisService.java`.

## Patterns

- Thin `@RestController` (`/api/...`) → `@Service` (`@Transactional`) → domain repos
- DTOs as nested records in `*Dtos.java`; errors via `ApiException` + `GlobalExceptionHandler`
- Ownership: `SecurityUtils.currentUser()` + `ProjectService.*Owned`
- Async: `AnalysisService.enqueue` → `AnalysisRunner` `@Async("taskExecutor")` → parsers
- Constructor injection; extend existing classes; `@Component` parsers, not `@Service`

## Profiles

- Default `dev-h2`: H2 file, `ngs.auth.disabled=true`
- `test` / `prod`: auth enabled (JWT)

## Tests

JUnit 5 under `src/test/java/com/ngs/analytics/` (mirror feature packages). Integration: `@ActiveProfiles("test")`.
